{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"陳潤潼當選港超聯8、9月最佳球員\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-10-22-16-32-05rOCksdx9.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】理文後衛陳潤潼首度獲選每月港超聯最佳球員。</p><p>24歲的陳潤潼季初由南區轉投理文，頭兩個月5場全部踢正選，更入了兩球，出色表現得到港隊徵召，在東盟盃上陣成為「大港腳」。他指轉投理文後更多時間參與進攻及直接埋門，希望保持穩定的表現，繼續入選港隊。</p><p>由於新球季於8月尾展開，所以首個每月最佳球員獎項會連同9月一同頒發。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:06.126712+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T08:18:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T03:18:07.106211+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T12:46:50.663025+00:00","content_hash":"25da755abb5d12ca332d6cc1859fd5519bbc7ea7345e49afb71e61f2e0689989","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:06.126712+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}